Optimization for Tacz is an unofficial add-on for the Minecraft mod
Timeless and Classics Zero (TaCZ). TaCZ is a separate project by its own
authors; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the TaCZ team
and contains no TaCZ code.

  * The mod icon is a derivative work based on TaCZ's own logo.png, with the
    author's own artwork and text on top. The TaCZ word mark and logo remain
    the property of the TaCZ project.
  * No TaCZ source code, binary, model or texture is redistributed by this
    repository. The build expects TaCZ to be installed in the game folder.

Nothing in the MIT license above grants any rights to TaCZ's assets.


